# route: level=w3_l1b_coop difficulty=expert players=2 ends=exit after=tally expect=wipes:0,eggs:0,x2_gates:2,painting:25
# w3_l1b_coop Expert two-stream route: "Blizzard Pass" for two (designer DB2; ticks:P1|P2; recorded from closed-loop
# duo bots, build/db2/bot_w3_l1b_coop.gd --ledge=1). Every jump waits for a lull that lasts (the Expert gusts reach
# 72), the waiting partner crouches through the gusts and nobody crouches while sliding on ice. A Shellback pincer at
# the cave mouth; the crevasse of pillars and the pond's floes one after the other (P1 waits on the last floe until
# the ridge charger has run past the far shore into the pond); up to the shelter ridge; the x2 secret 'lee': P2
# stands right of the ledge, P1 hops off his head in a lull, rides the bounce clear of the ledge's underside and
# lands on it (painting 25), then drops off its right end; over the ice bridge with a run-up; gate 'hut': P1 drops
# into the keeper hall through the first hole (bait), P2 through the second and clubs the first turtle's back; then
# P2 baits the second one while P1 climbs the vine, crosses the crust and drops behind it.
# Re-recorded in wf11 (levels; build/levels/bot_w3_l1b_coop.gd: the same bot, the striker of each pincer 38 px
# behind his turtle) for the ward of DESIGN G73 (no pogo off a keeper) and the crust's second hole, which lies
# one cell further left (columns 146-147).
